When no per-client resource exists, this fallback assumes the schema's Clients resource exists. If admin permissions were enabled before this resource type was added, or a realm has stale/partial authorization data, getResourceTypeResource can return null; the following findByResource(server, resource) then dereferences/null-passes that value and can fail with a 500 during ordinary permission checks. Match the other null-safe paths and deny the permission when the fallback resource is absent.

