View-all-groups grants manage-all-groups

`canManage()` is used by `GroupsResource.addTopLevelGroup` to authorize creating or moving top-level groups. In V2 this now accepts either `view` or `manage` on the all-groups resource, so an admin with only view-all-groups permission can create groups and otherwise pass global group management checks. Global manage should require the manage scope only, matching the per-group `canManage(GroupModel)` behavior.

